# list_skills — List Skills

List all loaded skills grouped by source (git repo, npm package, global, or project). Use when the user asks what skills are available.

## Schema
```json
{
 "type": "object",
 "properties": {}
}
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://list_skills.

